{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2014-meet-science2-35","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2014,"subject":"physics","number":35,"points":2.5,"unitId":"physics-fluid-thermal","unitLabel":"유체·열역학","topic":"압력·열역학·기체의상태","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["physics-fluid-thermal","physics-mechanics"],"stem":"그림은 1몰의 이상 기체의 상태가 A→B→C→D→A를 따라 \n순환하는 열역학 과정의 압력과 부피를 나타낸 것이다. A→B, \nC→D는 등온 과정, B→C, D→A는 정적 과정이다.\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n [2.5점]\n<보 기>\nㄱ. B에서의 압력은 2P0이다.\nㄴ. A→B 과정에서 기체가 한 일은 C→D 과정에서 기체가 \n방출한 열량의 2배이다.\nㄷ. B→C 과정에서 기체가 방출한 열량은 D→A 과정에서\n기체가 흡수한 열량과 같다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]}],"answer":2,"acceptedAnswers":[2],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":14,"height":23,"region":0,"bbox":[65.9,5.915,5.6,9.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2014-meet-science2-35/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":399,"height":347,"region":0,"bbox":[84.7,73.115,159.6,138.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2014-meet-science2-35/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":776,"height":273,"region":0,"bbox":[14.7,270.315,310.4,109.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2014-meet-science2-35/03.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":18,"sourceRect":[82.9,152.885,417.0,581.602],"width":334.1,"height":428.717,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[65.9,5.915,5.6,9.2],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[84.7,73.115,159.6